config AP3216C
	bool "LiteOn AP3216C ambient light and proximity sensor"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_LITEON_AP3216C_ENABLED
	select I2C
	help
	  Enable polling of ambient light, proximity and infrared data from
	  the AP3216C sensor. Interrupts and runtime gain changes are not supported.
